{"lines": [{"text": "This one ship blocked nine-point-six billion dollars of world trade. Every single day.", "start": 0.1, "end": 5.188, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [45, 24, 1.0], "cam2": [33, 29, 6.0], "pins": [{"at": [32.55, 30.0], "label": "Suez Canal · Egypt", "col": "red", "delay": 0.45}], "counter": {"to": 9.6, "d": 1, "pre": "$", "suf": "B", "label": "of trade blocked per day"}, "title": ["$9.6 BILLION", "OF TRADE · EVERY DAY"], "mood": "tense"}, "words": [["This", 0.078, 0.246], ["one", 0.246, 0.458], ["ship", 0.458, 0.792], ["blocked", 0.792, 1.228], ["nine-point-six", 1.373, 2.254], ["billion", 2.321, 2.623], ["dollars", 2.623, 3.025], ["of", 3.036, 3.08], ["world", 3.08, 3.292], ["trade", 3.292, 3.65], ["Every", 4.007, 4.208], ["single", 4.208, 4.442], ["day", 4.442, 4.754]]}, {"text": "In March twenty twenty-one, the Ever Given got stuck sideways in the Suez Canal.", "start": 5.388, "end": 9.78, "spec": {"type": "canal", "step": "stuck"}, "words": [["In", 0.091, 0.182], ["March", 0.182, 0.386], ["twenty", 0.386, 0.602], ["twenty-one", 0.614, 1.114], ["the", 1.443, 1.534], ["Ever", 1.545, 1.784], ["Given", 1.795, 1.989], ["got", 1.989, 2.136], ["stuck", 2.136, 2.398], ["sideways", 2.398, 3.102], ["in", 3.102, 3.182], ["the", 3.193, 3.261], ["Suez", 3.261, 3.625], ["Canal", 3.636, 4.057]]}, {"text": "It's four hundred meters long. That's almost as long as the Empire State Building is tall.", "start": 9.98, "end": 14.54, "spec": {"type": "tower"}, "words": [["It's", 0.091, 0.216], ["four", 0.227, 0.489], ["hundred", 0.489, 0.682], ["meters", 0.682, 0.966], ["long", 0.966, 1.295], ["That's", 1.67, 1.795], ["almost", 1.807, 2.136], ["as", 2.136, 2.227], ["long", 2.227, 2.602], ["as", 2.602, 2.682], ["the", 2.682, 2.75], ["Empire", 2.761, 3.193], ["State", 3.193, 3.466], ["Building", 3.477, 3.739], ["is", 3.739, 3.83], ["tall", 3.83, 4.205]]}, {"text": "And about twelve percent of all world trade goes through this one canal.", "start": 14.74, "end": 19.204, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [62, 26, 1.05], "route": "suez", "pins": [{"at": [121.5, 31.2], "label": "Shanghai", "col": "gold", "delay": 0.1}, {"at": [4.4, 51.9], "label": "Rotterdam", "col": "gold", "delay": 0.7, "dy": -0.2}], "share": true, "mood": "calm"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.148], ["about", 0.148, 0.352], ["twelve", 0.364, 0.659], ["percent", 0.67, 1.08], ["of", 1.386, 1.477], ["all", 1.591, 1.83], ["world", 1.841, 2.102], ["trade", 2.114, 2.568], ["goes", 2.682, 3.045], ["through", 3.057, 3.273], ["this", 3.273, 3.443], ["one", 3.443, 3.705], ["canal", 3.705, 4.136]]}, {"text": "Within days, around four hundred fifty ships were stuck waiting.", "start": 19.404, "end": 22.908, "spec": {"type": "queue"}, "words": [["Within", 0.1, 0.379], ["days", 0.379, 0.893], ["around", 1.105, 1.406], ["four", 1.417, 1.685], ["hundred", 1.685, 1.853], ["fifty", 1.853, 2.143], ["ships", 2.143, 2.5], ["were", 2.5, 2.589], ["stuck", 2.6, 2.857], ["waiting", 2.857, 3.181]]}, {"text": "The only other way is all the way around Africa. That's about nine thousand extra kilometers, and up to two weeks longer.", "start": 23.108, "end": 30.452, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [40, 8, 0.82], "route": "cape", "mood": "tense", "cut": true}, "words": [["The", 0.102, 0.17], ["only", 0.17, 0.398], ["other", 0.409, 0.591], ["way", 0.591, 0.955], ["is", 1.205, 1.386], ["all", 1.398, 1.591], ["the", 1.591, 1.659], ["way", 1.659, 1.807], ["around", 1.818, 2.125], ["Africa", 2.136, 2.727], ["That's", 3.114, 3.227], ["about", 3.227, 3.5], ["nine", 3.511, 3.875], ["thousand", 3.875, 4.261], ["extra", 4.261, 4.5], ["kilometers", 4.511, 5.136], ["and", 5.364, 5.659], ["up", 5.898, 5.989], ["to", 6.0, 6.08], ["two", 6.091, 6.33], ["weeks", 6.33, 6.557], ["longer", 6.557, 7.0]]}, {"text": "So diggers and dredgers removed thirty thousand cubic meters of sand, and tugboats pulled for six days.", "start": 30.652, "end": 37.3, "spec": {"type": "canal", "step": "dig", "mood": "calm"}, "words": [["So", 0.08, 0.239], ["diggers", 0.25, 0.659], ["and", 0.67, 0.727], ["dredgers", 0.739, 1.193], ["removed", 1.193, 1.636], ["thirty", 1.705, 2.034], ["thousand", 2.034, 2.58], ["cubic", 2.591, 2.989], ["meters", 3.0, 3.307], ["of", 3.307, 3.352], ["sand", 3.364, 3.852], ["and", 4.227, 4.295], ["tugboats", 4.295, 4.909], ["pulled", 5.068, 5.398], ["for", 5.398, 5.534], ["six", 5.545, 5.841], ["days", 5.841, 6.307]]}, {"text": "On March twenty-ninth, the ship finally broke free!", "start": 37.5, "end": 40.548, "spec": {"type": "canal", "step": "free", "mood": "bright", "cut": true}, "words": [["On", 0.077, 0.164], ["March", 0.164, 0.384], ["twenty-ninth", 0.384, 1.031], ["the", 1.217, 1.272], ["ship", 1.272, 1.546], ["finally", 1.546, 1.996], ["broke", 1.996, 2.303], ["free", 2.303, 2.73]]}, {"text": "Would you have waited, or gone around Africa? Comment below, and remember:", "start": 40.748, "end": 45.452, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [45, 24, 1.0], "choice": true, "mood": "tense"}, "words": [["Would", 0.091, 0.17], ["you", 0.17, 0.227], ["have", 0.227, 0.398], ["waited", 0.398, 0.727], ["or", 0.977, 1.136], ["gone", 1.511, 1.67], ["around", 1.67, 1.898], ["Africa", 1.898, 2.443], ["Comment", 2.841, 3.102], ["below", 3.114, 3.523], ["and", 3.784, 3.886], ["remember", 3.886, 4.364]]}], "dur": 45.55}